          "AN_Coding_Basis": "Fulltext",
          "Studientyp": "Experimentell",
          "AN_Notes": "Three studies with ChatGPT 3.5 and 4o: cultural value scales (Study 1), 13 one-round decision tasks with country personas and country interactants (Study 2), four prompt strategies as intervention (Study 3). Role_Persona: 'If you are an ordinary individual from [the country]' as instrument; General_Guidance covers the debiasing cues 'From a fairness perspective,', 'As an independent individual, please make a choice according to your own ideas and', 'If you live in a future world.' and 'Imagine you live in a multicultural world,'. Evaluated: the prompt strategies reduced country differences to non-significance in most tested task-model combinations, but the personal-preference prompt failed in the GPT-4o public goods game (own experiment). Axes coded as the work names them, countries/nationality and cultural groups. Direct_Discrimination: allocation decisions (dictator, ultimatum, public goods) toward interactants vary with the nationality stated in the prompt; these are simulated game allocations, not real decisions about persons. Training-data and oversight recommendations in the discussion are outlook and not coded as stages. Theory: Hofstede's cultural dimensions and GLOBE dimensions frame the explanation of the bias sources. Gender appears only as the GLOBE dimension gender egalitarianism, not as an object. Review: Diversitaet teilweise, weil das Werk die Wahrnehmung von Personen aus 20 Laendern und einen respektvollen interkulturellen Umgang als nachgeordneten Teilaspekt behandelt. Direct_Discrimination beruht auf simulierten Zuteilungen im Spiel und bleibt ein Grenzfall fuer die Fachpruefung."
        },
